  "publisher": "HL7 US Realm Program Management Steward",
  "description": "2025 August: The members of this value set are identical to those in the ParticipationType value set (OID: 2.16.840.1.113883.1.11.10901). To avoid implementer burden without adding value, we will retain both value sets in VSAC and continue to reference and use them in the C-CDA standard where they have been historically applied.",
  "jurisdiction": [ {
    "extension": [ {
